{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27923","headline":"题章正字道正新居 · 朱庆余","name":"题章正字道正新居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独在御楼南畔住，生涯还似旧时贫。\n全无竹可侵行迳，一半花犹属别人。\n吟处不妨嫌鼓闹，眼前唯称与僧邻。\n近来渐觉青莎巷，车马过从已有尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27923.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27923","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}